# --- Secrets & credentials (NEVER commit) ---
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
secrets/
**/secrets.*
*secret*
*credential*
*token*

# Test fixtures are DATA, never real secrets — the pre-commit secret SCAN (not
# this filename glob) is the real guard. Un-ignore test fixtures so legitimately
# named ones (e.g. secrets-absent.fixture.json, which proves a secret is ABSENT)
# are tracked and reach CI.
!**/fixtures/**
!**/*.fixture.json
# Test SOURCE files are code, never real secrets — un-ignore them so a test named
# e.g. no-secret-leak.selftest.mjs reaches CI (the pre-commit secret SCAN, not the
# filename glob, is the real guard).
!**/*.selftest.mjs
!**/*.test.mjs
# The shared design-token STYLESHEET is UI code, not a secret token — un-ignore it
# so it reaches CI (the `*token*` glob above is for secret token files only; the
# pre-commit secret SCAN is the real guard).
!**/tokens.css
# The VB1 session-token MODULE is executor SOURCE code (mint/use/revoke of short-lived
# session capabilities), not a secret token file — un-ignore it so it reaches CI (the
# `*token*` glob above is for secret token files only; the pre-commit secret SCAN is the
# real guard). Its selftest is already covered by the `*.selftest.mjs` rule above.
!src/v8b1/session-token.mjs
.npmrc

# --- Private store paths (source-system runtime state; never a dependency here) ---
.akior/
**/.akior/
*.session
sessions/

# --- Node ---
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log
.pnpm-debug.log*

# --- Local scratch / OS ---
.DS_Store
*.log
tmp/
scratch/
*.local.*

# --- Test / harness churn (local timelines are regenerated, not committed) ---
*.local.jsonl
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# agent worktrees (isolation) — never commit
.claude/worktrees/

# AKIOR-HARVEST #9: secret-shaped scratch files must never be swept in by a reflexive
# `git add -A` (the AKIOR B4 near-miss: a *.copy file dodged gitignore and nearly
# committed a secret). Keep these OUT of the index.
*.copy
cycle-*
